these are the types of datatypes 
what  is datatypes 👉 "(Data types) tell the computer what kind of data you are working with."

"primative" have the (string boolean null undefined symbol bigint) 

"non primative" datatypes is called the objects it include's  ("Arrays" and "objects" and "function")



lets talk about the diff between arrays and the objects 

Key Difference (Easy Rule)
Feature	      Object	                Array
Stores	      Single entity	            Multiple items
Access	      By key (user.name)	    By index (users[0])
Use case	  One user	                List of users

💡 Final Line (Remember This)

👉 Object = one user
👉 Array = multiple users
👉 Array of objects = real-world data